From 9529cbdc46880aec470c222210f34d5202c5d9f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fussell <dhfussell@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 20:45:04 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Add tail colour groups, justified columns, fractional
 delays

- tail_colors: "|"-separated hue groups of ","-separated shades (max 12),
  rendered from palette slots 8..19
- justify_columns: spread drawn columns flush to both screen edges
- update_delay / battery_update_delay accept non-integer values
- shader: 20 palette slots, column stride, guard against uncovered texels

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 MatrixScreen.qml        |  27 +++++++++++++++++----
 Service.qml             |   4 +++-
 cmatrix.js              |  16 +++++++++++--
 settings.js             |  52 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 shaders/matrix.frag     |  36 +++++++++++++++++++++-------
 shaders/matrix.frag.qsb | Bin 3872 -> 4383 bytes
 6 files changed, 116 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)

